# hashlayer-labs git author

When committing or pushing in **`hashlayer-labs`**:

- **Always** use author `pei76 <jiaqipei76@gmail.com>`.
- **Never** use `peijiaqi`, `peijiaq`, or `1278017494@qq.com` as author/committer.
- Repo uses `.githooks/` (`core.hooksPath=.githooks`): wrong author is rejected; Cursor `Co-authored-by` is stripped.
- After clone, ensure: `git config --local core.hooksPath .githooks` and pei76 name/email (or run once after clone).
- Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` to commit messages.
- Sync from mono must also commit as pei76 (see hashlayer `.github/workflows/sync-opensource.yml`).
